  "description": "In-game mail for SetNet: send messages with item attachments to players who may be offline; attachments are escrowed from the sender's inventory at send time and granted to the recipient on claim (no dupes, no loss). server.UseMail(store, inventory) + client.UseMail() → send/list/read/claim/delete + push on arrival. Pluggable IMailStore. Depends on SetNet + SetNet.Inventory.",
